    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "by default, it seems that mini.starter just suggests the most recent files I visited (or something like that). could I filter the suggestions such that only files in whatever directory i'm in (or children of that dir)",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">by default, it seems that mini.starter just suggests the most recent files I visited (or something like that). could I filter the suggestions such that only files in whatever directory i'm in (or children of that dir)</p>",
